{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b2f1f3f41f4d2eb4461df2eee070c04e87888b366af55f864682e91cd7e0d662",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4babd33c01a21883fbcf77c542587f10e083554771d9c160a9e1fca76e48561e",
      "text": "真心也好，谎言也罢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f4ee7188e38aaac86bd4fccfa50d9e690bb44bf93ede536e18d293fc72015f9",
      "text": "作为偶像出道后，想乐依然在继续大学生活。\n之所以尽可能想两者兼顾，其原因在于\n他对分居两地的父母怀有的复杂感情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4babd33c01a21883fbcf77c542587f10e083554771d9c160a9e1fca76e48561e",
      "text": "真心也好，谎言也罢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b13e6720d41ff0a36a33e337170f7d167c165f8daf038306d6ba774765879a3",
      "text": "想乐先生，您已经到了吗？\n来得真早啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:638be01143670fe928a0e6ca61652de21f8d075a93d098010c0f9f315506f2d5",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，早上好～。\n我想把大学的报告赶完，所以早点过来了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef657f928e4a6f69362dd5cde8f6dd841cc7107aa4bd79ffb4d29ae77b304e0e",
      "text": "原来是这样。既然如此，\n碰头会的时间要稍微推迟一点吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8046182b7a6fde43b1d02c07985f8489296b12bb2fcc9764620657901ddc0433",
      "text": "不用，已经进入润色阶段了，没关系的～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcf4bb4058c6fc43974c7be6ae71b48bb8f1a74a33610a71560b5865001580c9",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー总是\n连我的大学生活都会关照到呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:276efebffe420f1493f38f3a5e0ff312e52df0ec1495804205de7c247f3704de",
      "text": "多亏了你，我才能偶像和大学生两不误哦～。\n今后也请继续保持这样关照我啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1040a94dfb84b35cba145968ac4797fefa453b570ae1b8977b5a1e37b764ea03",
      "text": "好的，包在我身上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:534a7964e3231c17d4a3f1677a47296787c9fde86c03b5b67343e4242076f9ec",
      "text": "……嗯，报告差不多能看到完成的曙光了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d00ebfc8ffceb1fbc6aa836503412143ed8f5fd1817ffafae2e90a9b811df9c",
      "text": "既然●●●●プロデューサー也来了，\n虽然稍微早了点，我们就开始聊工作吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e7178462acca9c56baad8716d634ec33a3fdbc6671d76ab09e63417f9f7e173",
      "text": "这是新的日程安排。\n您觉得如何，接下来可能会稍微有些忙碌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa647b8a419ca5889249b33db75a874a5b1227d7de0f89f5b0701f16aeb7c4d6",
      "text": "……嗯，没问题。这样完全应付得来哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:077c76d20e1d869ba8cfd14ca89cf7c43c34ac19bc83818beb8dad6ff52ae082",
      "text": "最近之所以忙起来，是因为偶像的工作\n在一点点增加嘛……呼呼，真开心呀～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ba0c637792e8efc949c1b8d8596dc7170a1d52090991e65d903c379d1f7d241",
      "text": "不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78aede83d14c010c7ff34fa7fd7181ad1e25927aefdcaeb17afa50d0204e942c",
      "text": "毕竟学费是父母出的，今后\n大学的学分和出勤率也还是得多注意呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d4774be340934c9994e5b6911898be9a550ce1d9a3cce1f8ae5fb00e1d70369",
      "text": "偶像和学业两边都顺顺利利的，\n才能让那两个人放心嘛～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4022fe23004031ff2e81ce035b2f2fa0b996c4479ab284e9cfc97b66a10eeb03",
      "text": "想乐先生……\n您真的很重视父母呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91a669e0f96c97cfd6a706bebec1ed2c20f6fdce1125cdd4c218064423aeb9e4",
      "text": "哎？呼呼，谁知道呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a0993ec37b88127ffe9dfc472d8ca23949654ccf75d53992aa5a9eff10220f4",
      "text": "（这样啊，听起来像是在孝顺父母吗～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29fb15c4af46f45056770b6648b0c5b1e54032f0ce2ee22ebb0808c9d3d6a68a",
      "text": "（……嘛，被人看成好人也没什么坏处。\n真实想法，还是别说出来比较好吧～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef385f856f57310e3f834a7dc33e2f1112aad05d1ec2203d1dca55a99a6e676",
      "text": "话虽如此，离开老家\n一个人上大学，应该会有很多辛苦的事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00be4aad5d7f0b1c4cb53177b17f737b45e5462597457e192b2841e6c7e13c96",
      "text": "嗯——，有些人可能会觉得辛苦吧，\n但我因为是跟哥哥一起住的嘛～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b55a62bdcdb6b002f924a30e026427ed03f1ca0a45f84b38c2146f42cb75395e",
      "text": "和哥哥在一起的话，\n能让他教我做饭和打扫，很方便哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8be8d7ff499a3b0445590d84d082cab47728c1ae8afbea17c77f4182ad3f31a3",
      "text": "虽说那边是个大忙人，\n基本上都是我在被随意差遣就是了～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c162068856962de934d705afba6ca87a81ad26405b560013c1f54dda884c81ac",
      "text": "但是，能向哥哥请教\n那些生活技巧，真的很不错呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd6b117885cd8e97bb5b077a2ffceb7cc4fd7c5ec8c930be53635cdae95f290b",
      "text": "是吧是吧。两个人一起住还能省房租，\n身体不舒服的时候也能互相照应……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32dbc4227389fb1e4ef65802f19e0b96319c2aa89326490c13822d78edf1cae5",
      "text": "这样的话，就算离开老家也没问题了对吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6b65997febe869ce0dd3435d794a9bd5b2f812adb66faf592d556ddc07d8f7d",
      "text": "（……话说，当时也是这么跟那两个人解释的呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c170b17d20eb86fae3d21bb4008406e6fc45744be2e5467b358042274eebac1",
      "text": "（考大学的时候，想着这是逃离讨厌的老家的好机会，\n挖空心思编了各种各样的借口呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:322735b12d1321303f6e76ef67ae5733a1cabf292995af008bd0cb3691e69918",
      "text": "（“您真的很重视父母呢”，吗～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6bb5ff3d7bea8173a1de615412221faad477355de0f120e819e8ad7052a7813",
      "text": "（明明只是装成那样，实际上，\n不过是在任性地贯彻自己的想法而已呢～……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0e452020e44e6c849890580aa864dc5513a36d8c7847c9c76bd92d69de5b835",
      "text": "借着父母和哥哥的力量，\n大学和偶像工作两手抓，随心所欲……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72aa2eb23d95078abc7a4ecf4ffca9c878901c2fdbfc0c33e2b2e8e5a286cf8f",
      "text": "真要说的话，我其实是个很不孝的人呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee80a1680e1269881778e499c68f6e6f58fc10a36b555196776884c09e5c1c58",
      "text": "哎……没那回事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46de408182263a326f159fcf5d6f4d3ae32008a82e7e0d035a35e402eeeeb572",
      "text": "无论工作多忙，想乐先生不都一直\n兼顾着偶像与学业吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7923af9baffd52ad54ed76875bde09c5b2226873fb7d9f7fdf46a629fd5a415",
      "text": "虽说像这样制定了计划，\n但有时也并不总是能如期进行的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ba4ac197add0b5a88a37cf94edf8d21a052770443ffbe806cccc0a17e859cad",
      "text": "……比如，我明明是个偶像，\n运动能力却比大家都差～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:208a4ab7ae15389470efdb2c0df79d5ef357ebd838a51b34ae24e5279cb2fa5b",
      "text": "就像前几天的舞蹈课上，\n只有我一个人被留下来加练的时候那样～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b87a4e5326d0a7858188a45c2b37a31a0e5269a8289474ec9be3c56ca32374ac",
      "text": "是、是的。比如，\n就算遇到那样的挫折！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47fe1e987cdb441bdb26377bf99d7ecdb46d4cc1c73e5a1ff533ad615a35c19f",
      "text": "能够一直兼顾两边，正是因为想乐先生\n在努力让父母安心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78de4351f27e1828dadcd16cf9a7341d29d8e245cddb906dc43caa018b1ac6ea",
      "text": "……这样啊。我自己倒是没这种自觉呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6f797b53e22afe366a7cfcbcf65e05bb4b06ed58b7fdb6c3dbac4aebd44371f",
      "text": "（本以为只是做做样子，\n结果不知不觉中真的变成尽孝了吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_e:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60da77439494f9621d550de9d4794a5a719847d655e520ec0a100506fb81bdce",
      "text": "说起来，父母之前跟我说过呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82eaec0778ddd3fb7ae2b21fe164e032ff3e02562d99c811a47b479dcb133a30",
      "text": "说最近在电视和杂志上看到我精神满满的样子，\n他们很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f43354eadf84f7d5745d4ea53175debb28712e319c28c2732f69a537f1fa4b3d",
      "text": "倒也不是说之前完全没联系就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24e5b44aca78a627b77e536077695e9d38d6a9f49d60e4141f302e1272f7a995",
      "text": "是不是说明通过工作，\n比以前更好地传达给他们了呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89c110329ca19e6d9a48ee596b6c7303643dd728023ca7f5e96d433b5bc6e127",
      "text": "嗯，一定是的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcea35bb460d10eb2962fd6cf582c7be688567abfad40e6eefd212799c24b2b9",
      "text": "为了今后也能让您的父母安心，\n我也全力支持您的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63755c335387e2c462688f54270ba405b3005f8f70759798db2998943d09faac",
      "text": "呵呵，真让人安心呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61899e5b055e73c3abb7a2b439ff2ba50253c415fdf38ccec6a627845f24aab8",
      "text": "只要有●●●●プロデューサー在，\n我和父母都能放心了呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a16d94d2628af82904be413779293eb0c66e31bbb3e177f1e1a9bee9cffc04b",
      "text": "（而且，如果能继续和制作人一起努力下去，\n各种装出来的样子，说不定真的能变成现实呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3964d38bb9baef1d844bac2fb97586ccebc2e06d81250f991e8ad59b13cb1c16",
      "text": "为了让制作人也能安心，\n我也得加油才行了呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
